Package: svent-xfce
Architecture: all
Depends: svent-core, svent-artwork, xfce4, xfce4-terminal, xterm,
 xfdesktop4, xfce4-settings, xfce4-genmon-plugin, xfce4-whiskermenu-plugin,
 feh, fonts-jetbrains-mono, greybird-gtk-theme, xclip, iproute2,
 xdg-user-dirs, python3, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: elementary-xfce-icon-theme, xfce4-appfinder,
 xfce4-pulseaudio-plugin, network-manager-gnome, pavucontrol, firefox-esr
Description: Svent OS XFCE session defaults
 A dark XFCE session for Svent OS: a top panel, the Greybird-dark theme,
 xterm for catalog tools and the Svent wallpaper via the shared selector.
 Shipped as /etc/skel defaults so a new user gets it on first login.
 Choose this session in the installer.
